@baseUrl=http://localhost:8080

### post list
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### post info
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/1

### post upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "something",
  "content": "ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss",
  "author": 1
}

